                <mxCell id="notes2" value="Implementation keys:&#xa;• SHIR v5.56 supports UAMI with AzurePostgreSql v2.0 LS (System-assigned MI not supported on SHIR).&#xa;• Ensure AAD auth enabled on client PG; grant UAMI principal proper DB roles.&#xa;• DNS: hub must resolve each client PG FQDN to its private IP (link private DNS zones to hub, or use DNS Private Resolver).&#xa;• Git-enabled Dev ADF; promote via CI/CD to Test/Prod." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;strokeColor=#cfd8dc;fillColor=#f1f8e9;" parent="rg-data" vertex="1">
